  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement in standard of living for campesino families in the department of Granada, Nicaragua</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amendment blurb This amendment provides Nochari with an additional $60,000 and 12 months to provide farmers with technical assistance on sustainable agricultural practices and production of native seeds to diversify crops and improve nutrition. Nochari will promote collective sales to obtain better prices for key products such as mango and avocado and will establish a cooperative, which will improve market access and sales.</narrative>
  </description>
